    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1897">

                <pb facs="1405" n="1289" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg1289"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Spanish Ambassador to the Secretary of
                    State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Embassy of Spain</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-12-20">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">December 20, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Mr. Secretary</hi>: With reference to your
                    excellency’s note of November 16 last, I have the honor to inform you that His
                    Majesty’s Government, according to a telegram I have received, concurs in
                    extending from the 21st of June, 1915, to the 15th of February, 1916, the time
                    set by the Treaty of September 15, 1914, for the appointment of the
                    International Commission therein specified.</p>
                <p>In so informing your excellency, I avail myself of this opportunity to renew to
                    you the assurance of my highest consideration.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Juan Riaño.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
